{"3413210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmolace", "steam_appid": 3413210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ Optical Illusions x One-Stroke Drawing — A Puzzle Journey to Weave the  Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Weaver of the Cosmos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perspective as your weapon, and a single stroke as your order,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting scattered stars, filling the empty void of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◇ <strong>Optical Illusions: The Space is Not What It Seems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.poster.avif?t=1776431240\" width=336 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.webm?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.mp4?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From different angles, the structure of the world will shift.<br>Align scattered points to make them appear connected, creating a one-stroke path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◇ <strong>Special Mechanisms: Curves, Wormholes...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.poster.avif?t=1776431240\" width=398 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.webm?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.mp4?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wormholes</strong>: Connecting to one also connects its counterpart.<br><strong>Curves</strong>: The complexity of the levels increases, adding new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◇ <strong>Whispers of the Cosmos: Every Step Listens to the Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.poster.avif?t=1776431240\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.webm?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.mp4?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a whisper from the cosmos.<br>The optimal solution will reveal a deeper &quot;confession&quot;, unveiling the fuller story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ Visuals and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.poster.avif?t=1776431240\" width=560 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.webm?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.mp4?t=1776431240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Fantastical and Mysterious Cosmo</strong> — Explore the order within pure and beautiful geometric space.<br>🎨 <strong>Dynamic Cosmic Background</strong> — As you solve puzzles, the shape of the world subtly changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ This is More Than Just a Puzzle...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rules may seem logical, but feel subtly flawed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you truly solving the puzzle, or falling deeper into the maze?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths might only be discovered in the next cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... dark trials await.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ Who Is This Game For?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Space Puzzle Enthusiasts</strong> — Enjoy the novel solutions brought by perspective shifts.<br>🎭 <strong>Players Who Love Immersive Experiences</strong> — For those who appreciate atmosphere, art, and storytelling.<br>🔍 <strong>Thinkers Who Uncover Hidden Secrets</strong> — Can you discern the true rules behind the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📌 <strong>Are you ready to face the trials?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ Optical Illusions x One-Stroke Drawing — A Puzzle Journey to Weave the  Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Weaver of the Cosmos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perspective as your weapon, and a single stroke as your order,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting scattered stars, filling the empty void of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✦ Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◇ <strong>Optical Illusions: The Space is Not What It Seems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.