 >🌀 <strong>Space Puzzle Enthusiasts</strong> — Enjoy the novel solutions brought by perspective shifts.<br>🎭 <strong>Players Who Love Immersive Experiences</strong> — For those who appreciate atmosphere, art, and storytelling.<br>🔍 <strong>Thinkers Who Uncover Hidden Secrets</strong> — Can you discern the true rules behind the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📌 <strong>Are you ready to face the trials?</strong></p>", "short_description": "A narrative-driven puzzle game that combines &quot;optical illusions&quot; with &quot;single-stroke puzzle&quot; as its theme. Players rotate their perspective in a 3D space, using optical illusions to connect vertexes and segments, completing the patterns in each level with a single stroke.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/header.jpg?t=1776431240", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/d7cc31a87a13d7241900dedf6d95d92518978ae3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776431240", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/d7cc31a87a13d7241900dedf6d95d92518978ae3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776431240", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 with updates<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 7840H with Radeon 780M Graphics   3.80 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon 780M Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 with updates<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 7840H with Radeon 780M Graphics   3.80 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Mem